.TH geectl-gitea-repo-delete 1  "geectl-gitea-repo-delete 0.2.4" 
.SH NAME
geectl\-gitea\-repo\-delete \- Delete a repository. A mutation: dry\-run is the default (only the plan is printed); `\-\-live` performs the deletion. The library refuses without `\-\-force`, even live
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBgeectl gitea repo\-delete\fR [\fB\-\-force\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fIOWNER\fR> <\fIREPO\fR> 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Delete a repository. A mutation: dry\-run is the default (only the plan is printed); `\-\-live` performs the deletion. The library refuses without `\-\-force`, even live
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-force\fR
Confirm the deletion
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
<\fIOWNER\fR>
The repository owner
.TP
<\fIREPO\fR>
The repository name
.SH VERSION
v0.2.4
